# Degree edge cases: 0, 1, ranges, reversed/degenerate ranges, huge.
approx x*x in 0..1 degree 0 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 1 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 2
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 2..6 as f32 norational nosplit noreduce list 1
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 9..5 as f32 list 1
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree -1 as f32 list 1
approx sin(x) in 0..1 degree 40 as real norational nosplit noreduce list 1
